  "\"please open the door.\" \"just a minute.\"": "\"Por favor abra a porta.\" \"Só um minuto.\"",
  "\"please put this on the top.\" \"on top of what?\"": "''Por favor, coloque isso no topo.'' ''No topo de que?''",
  "\"please think about it carefully.\" \"think about what?\"": "\"Por favor, pensa cuidadosamente acerca disso.\" \"Penso acerca de quê?\"",
  "\"quiet,\" tom whispered.": "— Quieto — Tom sussurou.",
