  "\"thank you very much for everything.\" \"you are welcome.\"": "Muito obrigado por tudo. De nada.",
  "\"thank you very much.\" \"you're very welcome.\"": "\"Muito obrigado.\" \"Não tem de quê.\"",
  "\"thank you!\" \"you're welcome!\"": "\"Obrigada!\" \"De nada!\"",
  "\"thank you!\" - \"you're welcome.\"": "\"Obrigado.\" \"De nada.\"",
  "\"thank you.\" \"no, thank you.\"": "\"Obrigado.\" \"Obrigado a você.\"",
